<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned all three auctions whereby it sought to drain 1.473 billion pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    500 million    14 days   23.04 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    10 days   23.00 pct</p>
<p>    473 million     1 day    22.75 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
